WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:24.096
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:41.079
Why are you silent?

3
00:00:41.259 --> 00:00:42.358
Beautiful.

4
00:00:44.376 --> 00:00:46.633
So beautiful that I have no words.

5
00:01:19.181 --> 00:01:20.280
It seems...

6
00:01:21.019 --> 00:01:22.917
we will die here together.

7
00:01:23.417 --> 00:01:25.710
We apologize to all passengers.

8
00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:29.351
We have temporarily stopped due to problems
with electricity.

9
00:01:29.451 --> 00:01:34.266
The attraction will resume operations soon.
Please wait.

10
00:01:48.551 --> 00:01:50.410
How long will we stand?

11
00:01:53.147 --> 00:01:54.446
And you don't care.

12
00:01:54.665 --> 00:01:55.964
I see you are falling asleep.

13
00:01:59.980 --> 00:02:01.599
Today we will live.

14
00:02:03.137 --> 00:02:05.315
Lim Sol, it's time to get up.

15
00:02:08.811 --> 00:02:09.910
Lim Sol?

16
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:15.864
Lim Sol, are you feeling bad?

17
00:02:20.759 --> 00:02:21.858
Yes, you have a fever.

18
00:02:22.677 --> 00:02:24.376
Lim Sol, answer me.

19
00:02:25.075 --> 00:02:26.174
Lim Sol?

20
00:03:06.234 --> 00:03:08.092
EPISODE 15

21
00:03:12.108 --> 00:03:13.646
You will die...

22
00:03:14.066 --> 00:03:16.124
if you agree.

23
00:03:17.383 --> 00:03:18.841
Do you understand?

24
00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:20.799
Certainly.

25
00:03:21.698 --> 00:03:23.117
Strange woman.

26
00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:01.638
Song Jae...

27
00:04:05.614 --> 00:04:07.433
Song Jae...

28
00:04:17.642 --> 00:04:19.461
Song Jae...

29
00:04:28.631 --> 00:04:29.970
I'm here.

30
00:04:31.229 --> 00:04:32.328
You go to sleep.

31
00:04:34.665 --> 00:04:36.284
Medicines have been brought...

32
00:04:57.043 --> 00:05:00.216
What else is this? Are you looking after her?

33
00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.298
What else! I just don't want to wake her up.

34
00:05:03.157 --> 00:05:04.491
So what am I talking about?

35
00:05:04.515 --> 00:05:07.848
We need to wake her up and let her go home.
Why should she sleep?

36
00:05:07.872 --> 00:05:09.327
Do you want to leave it here?

37
00:05:09.351 --> 00:05:11.045
What, should I put it up?

38
00:05:11.069 --> 00:05:14.246
That is, you will stay here
alone in the middle of the night?

39
00:05:16.184 --> 00:05:18.322
Are you... What are you thinking?

40
00:05:18.701 --> 00:05:20.356
- And we are not alone!
- What?

41
00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.154
- Young woman?
- Young woman?

42
00:05:22.178 --> 00:05:23.712
- Crap.
- It turns out you...

43
00:05:23.736 --> 00:05:25.510
- Hello!
- Why did you come here?

44
00:05:25.534 --> 00:05:28.707
We are continuing the banquet.
And let's discuss business!

45
00:05:28.731 --> 00:05:32.024
What about a beauty call?
This is not a dorm.

46
00:05:32.048 --> 00:05:34.422
Do you have a girlfriend?

47
00:05:34.446 --> 00:05:37.423
How long have you been dating?
How did you find her?

48
00:05:37.522 --> 00:05:40.380
And who is she? I thought you were a loner.

49
00:05:41.518 --> 00:05:42.773
Ryu Sung Jae!

50
00:05:42.797 --> 00:05:45.690
Well, well, dear friends, you drank a lot.
Let's go.

51
00:05:45.714 --> 00:05:48.927
And he didn’t even tell us anything!
At least introduce me!

52
00:05:48.951 --> 00:05:51.285
- Who is she?
- Beautiful?

53
00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:54.641
- Crap.
- No comments! Let's go! Everything later.

54
00:05:54.665 --> 00:05:56.559
- Horror.
- Forward, forward!

55
00:05:56.583 --> 00:05:58.601
- Let's go! Quicker.
- Who is she?

56
00:06:19.401 --> 00:06:21.898
Sung Jae's house?

57
00:06:41.019 --> 00:06:42.118
Everything is fine?

58
00:06:48.012 --> 00:06:50.945
-Are you feeling better now?
- How did I end up here?

59
00:06:50.969 --> 00:06:52.228
Don't remember?

60
00:06:52.887 --> 00:06:54.306
You fainted.

61
00:06:54.366 --> 00:06:57.223
No, I remember that.

62
00:06:57.562 --> 00:06:59.261
How did I end up here?

63
00:06:59.401 --> 00:07:03.097
The hospital didn't admit us
and you felt bad.

64
00:07:03.277 --> 00:07:04.691
Should I have left you?

65
00:07:04.715 --> 00:07:06.613
It would be better if you left me.

66
00:07:07.792 --> 00:07:11.484
They would take me home.
You know the address.

67
00:07:11.508 --> 00:07:13.087
It was closer to me.

68
00:07:13.267 --> 00:07:14.601
And still...

69
00:07:14.625 --> 00:07:16.284
I had no choice.

70
00:07:16.543 --> 00:07:18.238
I took care of you.

71
00:07:18.262 --> 00:07:21.435
Even to a doctor I know
called in the middle of the night.

72
00:07:21.459 --> 00:07:22.717
What kind of interrogation is this?

73
00:07:23.137 --> 00:07:25.035
No no.

74
00:07:25.654 --> 00:07:28.192
I am greatly indebted to you.

75
00:07:28.571 --> 00:07:30.669
- Thank you.
- That's all?

76
00:07:32.448 --> 00:07:34.546
I'll repay you. Necessarily.

77
00:07:36.084 --> 00:07:37.822
We'll discuss this over breakfast.

78
00:07:38.082 --> 00:07:41.579
I have since yesterday evening
not a crumb in my mouth.

79
00:07:43.876 --> 00:07:47.612
I need to go home first.

80
00:07:47.672 --> 00:07:49.407
But I'll be back, honestly.

81
00:07:49.431 --> 00:07:51.009
Bon appetit.

82
00:07:55.904 --> 00:07:57.239
Where are my shoes?

83
00:07:57.263 --> 00:07:58.362
By the way...

84
00:07:58.462 --> 00:08:00.919
We were in a hurry and forgot them in the car.

85
00:08:01.379 --> 00:08:02.913
I'll call the manager.

86
00:08:02.937 --> 00:08:05.315
- What?
- Wait half an hour.

87
00:08:06.094 --> 00:08:07.513
Let's have breakfast.

88
00:08:07.932 --> 00:08:09.271
You can't go barefoot.

89
00:08:23.876 --> 00:08:26.773
The soup is still hot, blow it first.

90
00:08:27.712 --> 00:08:29.051
Blow and eat.

91
00:08:29.351 --> 00:08:31.489
What is this? Deja vu?

92
00:08:42.657 --> 00:08:44.356
Why don't you eat?

93
00:08:45.934 --> 00:08:49.591
This is why adults
and faint.

94
00:08:50.849 --> 00:08:53.067
No, I'm eating.

95
00:08:58.521 --> 00:08:59.620
Everything is fine?

96
00:09:04.196 --> 00:09:05.495
No temperature.

97
00:09:14.945 --> 00:09:16.044
What's happened?

98
00:09:17.662 --> 00:09:18.841
Nothing.

99
00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.277
Did you really make the soup yourself?

100
00:09:27.493 --> 00:09:29.551
This is delivery. But it's fresh.

101
00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:31.509
Just like me.

102
00:09:33.526 --> 00:09:35.624
This is really too much.

103
00:09:37.762 --> 00:09:39.700
By the way, you don't sleep well.

104
00:09:40.519 --> 00:09:41.618
What?

105
00:09:41.878 --> 00:09:43.896
- I?
- Don’t you remember...

106
00:09:44.196 --> 00:09:45.854
what did you do in your dream?

107
00:09:46.434 --> 00:09:47.892
What did I do?

108
00:09:48.991 --> 00:09:51.608
So what did I do?

109
00:09:52.188 --> 00:09:53.287
You...

110
00:09:55.944 --> 00:09:57.043
No.

111
00:09:57.502 --> 00:09:59.840
I'd rather not tell you.

112
00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.314
Why? Why?

113
00:10:02.338 --> 00:10:04.675
I'm afraid you'll die of shame.

114
00:10:09.251 --> 00:10:11.589
What kind of chain do you have...

115
00:10:13.926 --> 00:10:15.065
Forget it.

116
00:10:18.961 --> 00:10:20.580
And how will you repay me?

117
00:10:21.518 --> 00:10:25.015
Just don't say you'll treat me
coffee from a kiosk.

118
00:10:26.074 --> 00:10:27.728
What would you like?

119
00:10:27.752 --> 00:10:29.091
Don't quit.

120
00:10:29.750 --> 00:10:33.527
It's good when an employee can
figure it out on your own.

121
00:10:33.946 --> 00:10:35.764
The company will lose valuable personnel.

122
00:10:38.741 --> 00:10:40.839
You dreamed of becoming a director.

123
00:10:41.339 --> 00:10:42.757
The general director told.

124
00:10:43.337 --> 00:10:46.110
So many wonderful scripts
the world never saw it.

125
00:10:46.134 --> 00:10:47.752
You know better.

126
00:10:47.812 --> 00:10:49.271
Don't miss the chance.

127
00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:50.709
Is it really your dream...

128
00:10:51.089 --> 00:10:52.508
not worth it?

129
00:10:57.562 --> 00:10:59.780
I have another dream.

130
00:11:00.240 --> 00:11:01.339
Which?

131
00:11:02.957 --> 00:11:05.015
Happily ever after...

132
00:11:06.114 --> 00:11:09.011
live together with your loved one.

133
00:11:11.189 --> 00:11:13.367
And who is he?

134
00:11:14.865 --> 00:11:16.044
I won't tell.

135
00:11:19.061 --> 00:11:22.318
How does this relate to your work?

136
00:11:23.377 --> 00:11:26.154
Somehow connected. Don't interfere.

137
00:11:45.874 --> 00:11:48.328
Thank you very much. And when he arrives...

138
00:11:48.352 --> 00:11:49.970
I'll give you a ride. Let's go.

139
00:11:58.142 --> 00:12:00.799
So the shoes were in the closet all this time?

140
00:12:01.339 --> 00:12:03.836
I hid them so you wouldn't run away.
And what?

141
00:12:07.173 --> 00:12:08.272
You go?

142
00:12:08.771 --> 00:12:10.146
Or will you stay here?

143
00:12:10.170 --> 00:12:11.269
I'm coming!

144
00:12:15.964 --> 00:12:17.183
Look.

145
00:12:18.082 --> 00:12:20.100
Have you seen a similar person?

146
00:12:21.359 --> 00:12:22.458
I didn't see it.

147
00:12:22.957 --> 00:12:25.291
I'll give you the camera footage.

148
00:12:25.315 --> 00:12:27.688
Just please don't make a fuss.

149
00:12:27.712 --> 00:12:31.369
Otherwise the residents will hear about the kidnapping
and they will run away.

150
00:12:32.428 --> 00:12:33.726
I'll get there!

151
00:12:33.946 --> 00:12:35.405
I'll give you a ride.

152
00:12:36.224 --> 00:12:38.002
No need.

153
00:12:38.541 --> 00:12:39.760
Wow, Sol.

154
00:12:41.818 --> 00:12:42.917
Ryu Sung Jae?

155
00:12:44.176 --> 00:12:45.431
Were you together?

156
00:12:45.455 --> 00:12:47.473
We... We...

157
00:12:47.572 --> 00:12:49.031
Isn't that Ryu Sung Jae?

158
00:12:49.411 --> 00:12:51.065
- It's him! Think about it!
- Yesterday...

159
00:12:51.089 --> 00:12:53.507
I came for work.

160
00:12:54.326 --> 00:12:57.543
I decided to drop by in the morning,
to discuss matters.

161
00:12:58.002 --> 00:13:01.099
Ryu Sung Jae is starring in my film.

162
00:13:01.479 --> 00:13:02.578
Movie?

163
00:13:04.675 --> 00:13:07.013
I work in a film studio.

164
00:13:07.233 --> 00:13:10.050
We are always open to cooperation.

165
00:13:13.506 --> 00:13:16.320
But to tell you that we left
It’s not possible from one apartment.

166
00:13:16.344 --> 00:13:18.162
Otherwise I'll lose my job.

167
00:13:19.381 --> 00:13:20.919
Are you quitting yet?

168
00:13:26.254 --> 00:13:28.711
What are you doing here?

169
00:13:31.089 --> 00:13:32.707
I also came for work.

170
00:13:33.247 --> 00:13:34.546
Do you have everything?

171
00:13:34.845 --> 00:13:36.903
Let's go. I'll give you a ride.

172
00:13:37.403 --> 00:13:38.502
Let's!

173
00:13:39.001 --> 00:13:41.738
Call after you read the script.

174
00:13:41.838 --> 00:13:42.937
Let's go.

175
00:13:48.112 --> 00:13:50.609
- What?
- So you were my girlfriend.

176
00:13:51.309 --> 00:13:52.963
Since when am I a girlfriend?

177
00:13:52.987 --> 00:13:55.165
Well, not a friend. Girlfriend.

178
00:13:56.104 --> 00:13:57.602
Even I am ashamed.

179
00:13:58.142 --> 00:14:00.080
So it was him?

180
00:14:01.858 --> 00:14:02.957
Me too.

181
00:14:03.217 --> 00:14:04.591
She doesn't have a boyfriend.

182
00:14:04.615 --> 00:14:08.951
Live happily ever after
with your loved one.

183
00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:11.509
What kind of circus?

184
00:14:23.836 --> 00:14:25.734
Song Jae...

185
00:14:26.034 --> 00:14:27.772
Song Jae...

186
00:14:28.631 --> 00:14:30.450
What did she call me?

187
00:14:31.349 --> 00:14:32.927
how you held my hand...

188
00:14:33.786 --> 00:14:35.325
So what now?

189
00:14:36.583 --> 00:14:37.682
God.

190
00:14:38.581 --> 00:14:40.320
God. Damn this blanket!

191
00:14:54.805 --> 00:14:57.618
Since when did you stop
are there any crusts?

192
00:14:57.642 --> 00:14:59.616
Shameless! Food is disappearing!

193
00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:03.053
I won't finish eating everything anymore
to the last crumb.

194
00:15:03.077 --> 00:15:04.132
I've had enough.

195
00:15:04.156 --> 00:15:06.090
I also have pride.

196
00:15:06.114 --> 00:15:08.048
Now I'm an important person.

197
00:15:08.072 --> 00:15:11.804
Yes. From now on we will eat
only the filling

198
00:15:11.828 --> 00:15:13.722
only crispy pieces

199
00:15:13.746 --> 00:15:17.123
only juicy watermelon and strawberry pulp!

200
00:15:17.383 --> 00:15:19.996
- That’s how we’ll live!
- Only tender thighs,

201
00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.637
only fresh, airy buns.

202
00:15:23.377 --> 00:15:26.514
What went through your head this morning?
boogers?

203
00:15:26.613 --> 00:15:27.712
God.

204
00:15:27.972 --> 00:15:30.590
Bo Ah, will you have some yogurt?

205
00:15:30.689 --> 00:15:32.823
What's wrong with your parents?

206
00:15:32.847 --> 00:15:34.022
Mother!

207
00:15:34.046 --> 00:15:36.779
So that I don't see this again
in this house!

208
00:15:36.803 --> 00:15:40.136
No, have you become millionaires?

209
00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.657
I don't understand. Elon Musk will be simpler than you!

210
00:15:45.315 --> 00:15:48.128
By the way, dear, when do we
Shall we take the prize?

211
00:15:48.152 --> 00:15:51.449
You won a year ago
we have to hurry.

212
00:15:52.907 --> 00:15:55.005
Exactly. Our prize!

213
00:15:56.424 --> 00:15:57.678
We must go after him.

214
00:15:57.702 --> 00:16:00.120
I was your example.

215
00:16:01.099 --> 00:16:02.593
Everything was fine.

216
00:16:02.617 --> 00:16:05.674
How can you suddenly leave me?

217
00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:12.424
Sorry about yesterday.

218
00:16:12.448 --> 00:16:14.985
I didn't mean to offend you, CEO.

219
00:16:20.559 --> 00:16:21.974
Don't apologize.

220
00:16:21.998 --> 00:16:24.376
Better withdraw your application. Come back!

221
00:16:29.191 --> 00:16:31.529
I'll wait until a replacement is found.

222
00:16:42.777 --> 00:16:44.635
I looked through the records.

223
00:16:44.695 --> 00:16:47.073
Here. This camera faces the parking lot.

224
00:16:49.331 --> 00:16:50.749
Everything fits together.

225
00:16:51.409 --> 00:16:54.186
Stop. Taxi? Is he a taxi driver?

226
00:16:54.246 --> 00:16:56.380
I couldn't see the numbers.

227
00:16:56.404 --> 00:16:59.301
I looked for records from a different angle.
There is nothing.

228
00:17:04.635 --> 00:17:07.852
Look. Let's check the black box
this car.

229
00:17:08.591 --> 00:17:09.970
I already found out everything.

230
00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:11.844
This is a celebrity's car.

231
00:17:11.868 --> 00:17:12.967
Which?

232
00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:31.109
Ryu Sung Jae?

233
00:17:36.563 --> 00:17:38.382
How good.

234
00:17:39.321 --> 00:17:42.458
Bo Ah, do you like it here with grandma?

235
00:17:42.517 --> 00:17:43.812
- Like.
- Like!

236
00:17:43.836 --> 00:17:45.654
Of course I like it!

237
00:17:49.071 --> 00:17:50.170
Already got it.

238
00:17:52.228 --> 00:17:53.327
God.

239
00:17:55.225 --> 00:17:57.443
Man, man!

240
00:17:57.582 --> 00:17:59.720
You can't snore here.

241
00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:02.398
Man, go home and snore!

242
00:18:02.498 --> 00:18:04.755
What kind of a person is he?

243
00:18:05.934 --> 00:18:07.992
What's happened? What's happened?

244
00:18:08.292 --> 00:18:11.189
God. God. How bright it shines.

245
00:18:12.527 --> 00:18:15.141
- What happened?
- You can't snore here.

246
00:18:15.165 --> 00:18:17.662
Look, people can't sleep.

247
00:18:17.802 --> 00:18:18.977
It's like a tank is moving.

248
00:18:19.001 --> 00:18:20.655
- Did I snore?
- Yes!

249
00:18:20.679 --> 00:18:22.458
Sorry, I'm probably tired.

250
00:18:22.637 --> 00:18:23.736
God.

251
00:18:26.873 --> 00:18:27.972
Grandmother?

252
00:18:28.032 --> 00:18:30.565
I like!

253
00:18:30.589 --> 00:18:31.688
Wait.

254
00:18:31.948 --> 00:18:33.686
Are you the owner of Video Gyma?

255
00:18:33.746 --> 00:18:35.445
"THE BEST MEDICINE"

256
00:18:43.976 --> 00:18:45.435
What are you staring at?

257
00:18:48.172 --> 00:18:50.026
Come on. I'm not looking.

258
00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:52.064
Wait, wait, wait.

259
00:18:52.088 --> 00:18:53.183
- Wait.
- What, what?

260
00:18:53.207 --> 00:18:54.306
So.

261
00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.579
That's it.

262
00:19:03.077 --> 00:19:04.176
No?

263
00:19:04.396 --> 00:19:05.495
Wait!

264
00:19:06.074 --> 00:19:07.173
I forgot my medicine!

265
00:19:07.592 --> 00:19:08.891
She feels bad...

266
00:19:09.391 --> 00:19:11.289
and she forgot her medicine!

267
00:19:11.508 --> 00:19:13.842
This is a huge problem.

268
00:19:13.866 --> 00:19:15.365
It's a huge shame.

269
00:19:15.704 --> 00:19:17.558
I don't see a problem here.

270
00:19:17.582 --> 00:19:19.561
What? Don't you think this is a problem?

271
00:19:19.620 --> 00:19:21.279
These are antibiotics.

272
00:19:21.379 --> 00:19:24.192
Don't miss a single pill!

273
00:19:24.216 --> 00:19:26.150
Even if you feel better

274
00:19:26.174 --> 00:19:28.831
You need to complete the course of treatment!

275
00:19:28.891 --> 00:19:30.190
What are you doing?

276
00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:33.183
- Of course.
- If you quit treatment, that’s it!

277
00:19:33.207 --> 00:19:35.465
Next time antibiotics won't help!

278
00:19:35.524 --> 00:19:38.462
What if something happens to Lim Seol...

279
00:19:38.921 --> 00:19:40.056
I will be uncomfortable.

280
00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.375
Uncomfortable?

281
00:19:41.399 --> 00:19:45.211
Never before have people died
from a couple of missed pills.

282
00:19:45.235 --> 00:19:47.173
Never say never.

283
00:19:47.992 --> 00:19:52.607
No no. I'm of course very tired
and I don't want to go anywhere...

284
00:19:53.467 --> 00:19:55.764
but there is no choice. We have to go.

285
00:19:58.182 --> 00:20:00.555
Okay, rest. I'm right on my way.

286
00:20:00.579 --> 00:20:02.558
- I'll deliver it.
- Tong Seok...

287
00:20:04.336 --> 00:20:06.909
- Why is this?
- You said you were tired.

288
00:20:06.933 --> 00:20:10.709
No no. I would go to bed, but I'll go.

289
00:20:13.127 --> 00:20:14.625
- Tong Sok.
- Yes?

290
00:20:14.685 --> 00:20:18.502
You see, I don't want to burden you.

291
00:20:19.441 --> 00:20:20.540
Go home.

292
00:20:20.799 --> 00:20:23.457
It's OK. I'm right on my way.

293
00:20:23.596 --> 00:20:24.975
Let's.

294
00:20:25.075 --> 00:20:26.174
Ton Sok.

295
00:20:26.274 --> 00:20:27.369
Well?

296
00:20:27.393 --> 00:20:29.447
You work from nine to six.

297
00:20:29.471 --> 00:20:31.369
Yes? But it's already eight.

298
00:20:31.788 --> 00:20:34.166
I'll go home. Thank you.

299
00:20:42.178 --> 00:20:44.711
Certainly! It was Ryu Sung Jae!

300
00:20:44.735 --> 00:20:48.108
If I knew, I would run for a piece of paper.
I should have gotten an autograph

301
00:20:48.132 --> 00:20:49.630
when Sun Jae brought his mom.

302
00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:52.543
Come to our restaurant,
We'll give you an autograph.

303
00:20:52.567 --> 00:20:53.502
- Is it true?
- Yes.

304
00:20:53.526 --> 00:20:55.545
Thank you, we'll come.

305
00:20:56.124 --> 00:21:00.416
Good for you, I guess.
You have such a popular son.

306
00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:02.933
By the way, I was watching the news one day.

307
00:21:02.957 --> 00:21:07.249
They said Ryu Sung Jae bought
A 10-story building somewhere in Cheongdam-dong.

308
00:21:07.273 --> 00:21:10.725
Building in Cheongdam-dong? No no. No.

309
00:21:10.749 --> 00:21:12.248
- No?
- No.

310
00:21:12.547 --> 00:21:15.361
- So, rumors.
- Not in Cheongdam-dong, but in Sochodong.

311
00:21:15.385 --> 00:21:17.123
And 6-storey.

312
00:21:17.782 --> 00:21:20.875
Although there are four basement floors.
It turns out that there are only ten.

313
00:21:20.899 --> 00:21:23.916
I don't know, I'm not good at arithmetic.

314
00:21:24.296 --> 00:21:26.989
And on the ground floor they opened a coffee shop.

315
00:21:27.013 --> 00:21:28.671
- Have you opened a coffee shop?
- Yes.

316
00:21:29.131 --> 00:21:32.188
My God, how I envy you. God.

317
00:21:32.607 --> 00:21:36.420
Mister Ryu, does Sung Jae have someone?

318
00:21:36.444 --> 00:21:37.862
No.

319
00:21:37.922 --> 00:21:40.899
I wish he would get married soon

320
00:21:41.159 --> 00:21:44.571
but Sung Jae is so busy,
that there is no time for dates.

321
00:21:44.595 --> 00:21:50.126
That's great. I'm just at
there is a suitable candidate.

322
00:21:50.150 --> 00:21:52.044
Maybe we can arrange a meeting for them?

323
00:21:52.068 --> 00:21:55.560
- What?
- She is good, kind, smart.

324
00:21:55.584 --> 00:21:58.877
Works in a film studio, so they will,
something to talk about.

325
00:21:58.901 --> 00:22:02.198
And most importantly - her beauty
drives people crazy.

326
00:22:03.177 --> 00:22:04.392
- Is it true?
- Yes!

327
00:22:04.416 --> 00:22:05.794
Who is this?

328
00:22:05.854 --> 00:22:07.073
My daughter.

329
00:22:12.607 --> 00:22:14.106
Here's how.

330
00:22:16.683 --> 00:22:18.542
Thank you.

331
00:22:18.801 --> 00:22:22.937
Sung Jae takes after me,
he is very demanding.

332
00:22:24.396 --> 00:22:26.090
Have you even seen my Salt?

333
00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:28.727
I saw it when we lived nearby.

334
00:22:28.751 --> 00:22:31.688
She ran here and there every day.

335
00:22:31.788 --> 00:22:33.802
And if my memory serves me right,

336
00:22:33.826 --> 00:22:37.918
She's not that pretty
to make people go crazy.

337
00:22:37.942 --> 00:22:40.755
My God. Beauty is in the eye of the beholder!

338
00:22:40.779 --> 00:22:42.474
And who knows? Maybe your son...

339
00:22:42.498 --> 00:22:46.993
- ...will immediately fall in love with her.
- But he definitely won’t go crazy.

340
00:22:47.413 --> 00:22:50.505
My son worked with the most beautiful
women of the world

341
00:22:50.529 --> 00:22:54.506
and didn’t even bat an eyelid.
This is my boy.

342
00:22:55.165 --> 00:22:56.539
Well, I'll go.

343
00:22:56.563 --> 00:22:59.017
These are the boys
and turn out to be womanizers.

344
00:22:59.041 --> 00:23:00.180
I'll go too.

345
00:23:03.796 --> 00:23:06.294
This is not a woman, this is a thug.

346
00:23:06.593 --> 00:23:09.646
God. Never in my entire life
I didn't see

347
00:23:09.670 --> 00:23:12.004
for Sun Jae to run after someone.

348
00:23:12.028 --> 00:23:13.522
Will he go crazy?

349
00:23:13.546 --> 00:23:15.804
God, I'm going crazy.

350
00:23:17.622 --> 00:23:19.401
What should I tell her?

351
00:23:21.818 --> 00:23:22.917
Give it to her.

352
00:23:23.177 --> 00:23:24.276
No.

353
00:23:24.376 --> 00:23:26.034
Or just leave it.

354
00:23:26.214 --> 00:23:27.313
Are you stupid?

355
00:23:30.010 --> 00:23:33.982
The doctor prescribed you medicine.
I didn't want to come, but I had to.

356
00:23:34.006 --> 00:23:36.064
No, that's a bit rude.

357
00:23:39.241 --> 00:23:40.659
I'm trying too hard.

358
00:23:40.799 --> 00:23:44.056
If anyone sees it, they think
that I'm running after her.

359
00:23:58.142 --> 00:24:00.320
What? Does she have a child?

360
00:24:04.256 --> 00:24:07.233
Min Jae, do you like hanging out with your aunt?

361
00:24:08.092 --> 00:24:10.270
With your aunt? Is this your nephew?

362
00:24:10.929 --> 00:24:12.068
Fine.

363
00:24:13.606 --> 00:24:15.265
In terms of? What's "good"?

364
00:24:15.325 --> 00:24:17.259
Why aren't you sleeping yet?

365
00:24:17.283 --> 00:24:19.257
The earlier you go to bed, the earlier you get up.

366
00:24:19.281 --> 00:24:21.295
What is she doing outside in this weather?

367
00:24:21.319 --> 00:24:24.296
- Ku-ku!
- Yes, and I dressed lightly.

368
00:24:25.594 --> 00:24:28.132
Min Jae, let me sing you a song?

369
00:24:30.430 --> 00:24:34.322
Once upon a time there were three bears.
All in one house.

370
00:24:34.346 --> 00:24:38.318
Papa Bear, Mama Bear
and a bear cub.

371
00:24:38.342 --> 00:24:42.278
Papa Bear is like this.

372
00:24:42.338 --> 00:24:43.756
Mom...

373
00:24:47.293 --> 00:24:50.989
Min Jae, when are you going to fall asleep?

374
00:24:56.164 --> 00:24:58.298
And why did you hide?

375
00:24:58.322 --> 00:25:00.220
It will be very strange.

376
00:25:10.909 --> 00:25:13.087
Someone was there too.

377
00:25:19.780 --> 00:25:20.879
Crap!

378
00:25:25.415 --> 00:25:26.554
I'll go crazy.

379
00:25:27.373 --> 00:25:30.190
Sorry. Your phone has fallen.

380
00:25:35.365 --> 00:25:36.623
I'll pick it up.

381
00:25:37.323 --> 00:25:38.582
Don't worry.

382
00:25:39.481 --> 00:25:40.939
What's wrong with him?

383
00:25:41.958 --> 00:25:43.377
BAEK IN HYUK

384
00:25:59.341 --> 00:26:01.235
Ryu Sung Jae, where are you?

385
00:26:01.259 --> 00:26:02.593
Damn Baek In Hyuk!

386
00:26:02.617 --> 00:26:03.716
Hey Sung Jae!

387
00:26:04.016 --> 00:26:05.195
Ryu Sung Jae!

388
00:26:05.574 --> 00:26:07.513
Why don't you answer?

389
00:26:08.012 --> 00:26:09.506
Ryu Sung Jae!

390
00:26:09.530 --> 00:26:11.589
- What a moron.
- Ryu Sung Jae!

391
00:26:11.928 --> 00:26:13.027
Oh well.

392
00:26:14.326 --> 00:26:16.104
Ryu Sung Jae?

393
00:26:30.390 --> 00:26:31.968
What are you doing here?

394
00:26:37.902 --> 00:26:39.081
Don't you see?

395
00:26:43.856 --> 00:26:45.155
I'm riding down the hill.

396
00:26:46.214 --> 00:26:47.672
So yes.

397
00:26:47.812 --> 00:26:49.910
Why are you going downhill?

398
00:26:50.649 --> 00:26:51.748
Well...

399
00:26:52.288 --> 00:26:53.423
Having fun.

400
00:26:53.447 --> 00:26:54.541
In the middle of the night?

401
00:26:54.565 --> 00:26:55.820
It doesn't work during the day.

402
00:26:55.844 --> 00:26:58.861
You know, I'm a celebrity.

403
00:27:00.400 --> 00:27:01.658
Have you come to see me?

404
00:27:02.038 --> 00:27:03.137
Yes.

405
00:27:03.676 --> 00:27:04.775
No no.

406
00:27:07.752 --> 00:27:09.051
Is it true?

407
00:27:10.709 --> 00:27:11.808
If so...

408
00:27:12.787 --> 00:27:15.325
I won't interfere with your fun.

409
00:27:17.542 --> 00:27:18.641
Wait!

410
00:27:21.738 --> 00:27:22.837
In fact...

411
00:27:23.497 --> 00:27:24.715
I brought medicine.

412
00:27:25.455 --> 00:27:27.588
Antibiotics must be taken
on schedule,

413
00:27:27.612 --> 00:27:29.071
no gaps.

414
00:27:29.730 --> 00:27:32.823
Of course, I didn’t come on purpose.

415
00:27:32.847 --> 00:27:34.941
I'm done filming.

416
00:27:34.965 --> 00:27:36.703
And I was on my way.

417
00:27:38.202 --> 00:27:39.341
Don't take this the wrong way.

418
00:27:39.920 --> 00:27:41.379
Thank you.

419
00:27:42.677 --> 00:27:43.812
Everything is fine.

420
00:27:43.836 --> 00:27:46.534
Why did you go outside in this weather?

421
00:27:47.033 --> 00:27:49.291
What if you feel bad again?

422
00:27:50.310 --> 00:27:51.409
Just...

423
00:27:51.868 --> 00:27:55.285
the child will not sleep,
if you don't take him for a walk.

424
00:27:57.103 --> 00:27:58.202
So he never sleeps.

425
00:28:06.733 --> 00:28:09.071
Yes, dear. Don't cry, don't cry.

426
00:28:12.088 --> 00:28:13.307
My exit.

427
00:28:19.760 --> 00:28:21.415
If you have everything, go.

428
00:28:21.439 --> 00:28:22.897
Not calming down?

429
00:28:24.076 --> 00:28:25.175
Give it to me.

430
00:28:27.632 --> 00:28:29.610
Quiet, quiet. Quiet, quiet.

431
00:28:29.830 --> 00:28:32.248
Hush, baby. Hush, hush.

432
00:28:34.386 --> 00:28:36.999
In this position the child
will calm down quickly.

433
00:28:37.023 --> 00:28:40.036
They say children feel
anxiety of adults.

434
00:28:40.060 --> 00:28:41.594
Relax.

435
00:28:41.618 --> 00:28:42.717
So...

436
00:28:43.377 --> 00:28:45.395
if a child cries...

437
00:28:45.734 --> 00:28:47.433
take him in your arms...

438
00:28:47.612 --> 00:28:50.030
and rock and spank.
Like this.

439
00:28:50.889 --> 00:28:52.228
Like this. Like this.

440
00:28:54.046 --> 00:28:55.221
God! He...

441
00:28:55.245 --> 00:28:57.782
- My God!
- Just a minute!

442
00:28:59.361 --> 00:29:02.218
Are you okay, Min Jae?

443
00:29:05.594 --> 00:29:08.372
God. God, you are so sweet.

444
00:29:18.501 --> 00:29:21.359
Go crazy. What is this?

445
00:29:23.177 --> 00:29:25.115
Why does he take so long to wash himself?

446
00:29:33.566 --> 00:29:35.784
I just recently bought this!

447
00:29:37.003 --> 00:29:39.461
Did you use up all the shower gel?

448
00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:42.578
Do you know who is to blame for this?

449
00:29:58.302 --> 00:30:01.479
Are you completely insolent? Forgot to get dressed?

450
00:30:02.458 --> 00:30:04.196
There is nothing to wear.

451
00:30:04.416 --> 00:30:05.674
What should I do?

452
00:30:09.930 --> 00:30:11.109
Sorry.

453
00:30:13.167 --> 00:30:16.544
- Get dressed and leave.
- I’ll leave, even if you ask me to stay.

454
00:30:17.962 --> 00:30:21.019
And when you felt bad,
you didn't let me go.

455
00:30:21.558 --> 00:30:23.217
When did this happen?

456
00:30:30.709 --> 00:30:33.087
Get dressed quickly.

457
00:30:38.302 --> 00:30:41.119
- Have you arrived?
- Madam Mal Ja, I’ll open it now.

458
00:30:42.178 --> 00:30:43.277
Follow me.

459
00:30:44.416 --> 00:30:45.515
Here!

460
00:31:00.919 --> 00:31:02.933
-Are you home already?
- Yes.

461
00:31:02.957 --> 00:31:04.691
- And your grandson?
- He's been sleeping for a long time.

462
00:31:04.715 --> 00:31:07.369
- Geum and Hyun Joo?
- They ran away somewhere.

463
00:31:07.393 --> 00:31:10.765
- Bo Ah, go brush your teeth.
- Then I'll go to my place.

464
00:31:10.789 --> 00:31:11.888
Go, go.

465
00:31:20.180 --> 00:31:21.439
What's wrong with you?

466
00:31:22.777 --> 00:31:23.996
It's not all bad.

467
00:31:27.173 --> 00:31:29.187
How can I explain this to my mother?

468
00:31:29.211 --> 00:31:31.025
We are business partners.

469
00:31:31.049 --> 00:31:33.862
And what does a business partner do?
in my soul?

470
00:31:33.886 --> 00:31:35.505
Strange, tell me?

471
00:31:36.444 --> 00:31:39.736
When everyone goes to bed, you will leave.
Let's wait 10 minutes.

472
00:31:39.760 --> 00:31:41.738
What will we do during this time?

473
00:31:42.837 --> 00:31:44.655
I mean, what should I do?

474
00:31:45.235 --> 00:31:46.893
Just sit quietly.

475
00:32:05.455 --> 00:32:08.232
It is indecent to rummage through a girl's things.

476
00:32:08.651 --> 00:32:10.669
Since when am I a girlfriend?

477
00:32:12.527 --> 00:32:15.305
Lim Sol, you are not my friend.

478
00:32:15.884 --> 00:32:16.983
What?

479
00:32:17.762 --> 00:32:18.861
Nothing.

480
00:32:26.114 --> 00:32:27.213
What is this?

481
00:32:27.552 --> 00:32:28.651
Give it back.

482
00:32:33.946 --> 00:32:35.045
My God.

483
00:32:35.465 --> 00:32:36.923
Everything is fine. Give it.

484
00:32:36.983 --> 00:32:38.278
They're broken.

485
00:32:38.302 --> 00:32:40.476
- I'll fix it.
- No need. Give it here.

486
00:32:40.500 --> 00:32:43.073
I hate feeling guilty.

487
00:32:43.097 --> 00:32:44.635
Everything is fine.

488
00:32:45.255 --> 00:32:46.394
Even so?

489
00:32:48.971 --> 00:32:51.589
What? Why did you take my watch?

490
00:32:57.043 --> 00:32:58.422
It's school time.

491
00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:01.774
This is a form of Jagam.

492
00:33:01.798 --> 00:33:03.696
- Don't look.
- Beautiful.

493
00:33:07.033 --> 00:33:09.451
Come on, what's beautiful there?

494
00:33:09.630 --> 00:33:10.729
Form.

495
00:33:12.388 --> 00:33:13.487
Exactly.

496
00:33:14.226 --> 00:33:16.324
We had a beautiful uniform.

497
00:33:18.541 --> 00:33:19.640
We really...

498
00:33:20.460 --> 00:33:22.833
never met?

499
00:33:22.857 --> 00:33:23.956
What?

500
00:33:24.855 --> 00:33:27.309
No... No... Not even once!

501
00:33:27.333 --> 00:33:29.391
We have never met.

502
00:33:37.203 --> 00:33:38.661
Stop watching already!

503
00:33:39.760 --> 00:33:41.778
Why? I like.

504
00:33:41.918 --> 00:33:44.651
Do you have some kind of fetish for school uniforms?

505
00:33:44.675 --> 00:33:47.133
Come on. I just like it.

506
00:33:49.910 --> 00:33:52.887
No. How can you throw yourself away?
in these words?

507
00:33:53.706 --> 00:33:55.121
What if we get caught?

508
00:33:55.145 --> 00:33:56.963
Are you talking on the phone?

509
00:33:57.502 --> 00:34:00.200
Yes, yes, mom, I already talked.

510
00:34:00.539 --> 00:34:02.478
It's late, go to bed.

511
00:34:25.754 --> 00:34:27.493
Everyone fell asleep.

512
00:34:37.383 --> 00:34:38.841
This is not the first time for you.

513
00:34:40.020 --> 00:34:41.634
What? What are you talking about?

514
00:34:41.658 --> 00:34:42.997
Take my hand.

515
00:34:43.896 --> 00:34:46.034
They weren't even shy.

516
00:34:48.731 --> 00:34:49.830
I...

517
00:34:50.290 --> 00:34:53.107
Let's go quickly. Quicker.

518
00:34:59.041 --> 00:35:01.494
What if someone wakes up? Go away!

519
00:35:01.518 --> 00:35:05.015
Faster! Let's! Go.

520
00:35:11.708 --> 00:35:12.807
Goodbye.

521
00:35:26.294 --> 00:35:27.553
What is this?

522
00:35:35.325 --> 00:35:36.703
Thank you.

523
00:35:40.040 --> 00:35:41.139
Is this Ryu Sung Jae?

524
00:35:57.902 --> 00:36:02.318
I dreamed that I was kissing
with a girl.

525
00:36:06.573 --> 00:36:09.351
This is neither a vision nor a dream.

526
00:36:10.609 --> 00:36:12.268
And I wasn't drunk.

527
00:36:13.007 --> 00:36:14.266
Hallucinations?

528
00:36:19.081 --> 00:36:22.058
- God!
-Did you dream of a kiss?

529
00:36:22.118 --> 00:36:24.136
What are you doing here?

530
00:36:24.236 --> 00:36:25.650
What other visions?

531
00:36:25.674 --> 00:36:28.572
Kiss for real!
There is a girl.

532
00:36:28.751 --> 00:36:30.330
I don't have a girlfriend.

533
00:36:32.268 --> 00:36:34.002
Who did you bring to you then?

534
00:36:34.026 --> 00:36:35.485
Business partner.

535
00:36:36.623 --> 00:36:39.197
And you dreamed of a kiss
with a business partner?

536
00:36:39.221 --> 00:36:40.919
I'm telling you, no.

537
00:36:41.858 --> 00:36:43.037
Jerk.

538
00:36:43.536 --> 00:36:44.635
Just...

539
00:36:46.054 --> 00:36:49.031
every time I see her
come to mind...

540
00:36:49.131 --> 00:36:51.988
some scenes, like excerpts from a movie.

541
00:36:53.247 --> 00:36:55.904
Is it true? And how does that make you feel?

542
00:36:56.404 --> 00:36:59.261
I'm worried and upset.

543
00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:01.259
But why?

544
00:37:02.118 --> 00:37:03.936
- Fell in love.
- What?

545
00:37:03.996 --> 00:37:05.135
Fell in love!

546
00:37:06.154 --> 00:37:08.008
- It's time for you.
- Why?

547
00:37:08.032 --> 00:37:11.285
You're worried, you're upset, that means...
you feel something.

548
00:37:11.309 --> 00:37:13.007
If this is not love, then you are an idiot.

549
00:37:13.147 --> 00:37:15.884
Yes, I'm an idiot. Go already.

550
00:37:16.024 --> 00:37:17.279
I came on business.

551
00:37:17.303 --> 00:37:19.676
Some people don't answer the phone.

552
00:37:19.700 --> 00:37:20.919
What do you have?

553
00:37:21.219 --> 00:37:23.912
Remember, you were in the group with me
Kim Tae Sun?

554
00:37:23.936 --> 00:37:25.714
So cute.

555
00:37:26.414 --> 00:37:29.710
So, he became a detective.

556
00:37:30.090 --> 00:37:33.307
Wants to talk to you
asked to arrange a meeting.

557
00:37:33.966 --> 00:37:37.822
- Detective?
- Detective Kim Tae-sung from Wonbok Station.

558
00:37:40.999 --> 00:37:42.613
- Glad to see you again.
- Mutually.

559
00:37:42.637 --> 00:37:44.372
What? Have you met yet?

560
00:37:44.396 --> 00:37:46.214
Recently. Accidentally?

561
00:37:47.033 --> 00:37:48.771
What is this urgent matter?

562
00:37:49.550 --> 00:37:51.928
We need records from your black box.

563
00:37:52.707 --> 00:37:54.166
What happened?

564
00:37:54.985 --> 00:37:56.280
Did you crash into someone?

565
00:37:56.304 --> 00:37:58.597
Would you like to explain everything to me first?

566
00:37:58.621 --> 00:38:03.157
Almost close to your home
your fan was kidnapped.

567
00:38:03.696 --> 00:38:05.231
- What?
- Is it true?

568
00:38:05.255 --> 00:38:08.631
The suspect's car may
got into the frame.

569
00:38:08.731 --> 00:38:10.390
We need numbers.

570
00:38:12.368 --> 00:38:14.661
Is the girl okay? She...

571
00:38:14.685 --> 00:38:16.983
Fortunately, she was not injured.

572
00:38:17.762 --> 00:38:18.861
Fine.

573
00:38:19.321 --> 00:38:20.575
I'll send you the notes.

574
00:38:20.599 --> 00:38:21.698
God.

575
00:38:21.918 --> 00:38:23.537
How scary it is to live.

576
00:38:24.276 --> 00:38:25.490
Find this freak.

577
00:38:25.514 --> 00:38:26.613
Let's find it.

578
00:38:31.309 --> 00:38:33.926
I heard our Sol is making a film.

579
00:38:34.985 --> 00:38:36.883
Your Salt, then?

580
00:38:38.262 --> 00:38:39.361
Well.

581
00:38:39.580 --> 00:38:41.638
- What's next?
-Are you busy now?

582
00:38:42.058 --> 00:38:43.357
I'm always busy.

583
00:38:44.655 --> 00:38:47.712
So busy that there is no time
for negotiations?

584
00:38:48.012 --> 00:38:50.989
Since you invite me early in the morning
Salt to yourself.

585
00:38:51.968 --> 00:38:53.782
You interfere in other people's affairs.

586
00:38:53.806 --> 00:38:56.264
Certainly. These are the affairs of our Sol.

587
00:38:58.082 --> 00:38:59.541
Why are you...

588
00:39:00.480 --> 00:39:02.334
call her yours?

589
00:39:02.358 --> 00:39:03.457
I'm so used to it.

590
00:39:04.396 --> 00:39:09.251
By the way, what is this our Ryu Sung Jae?
so suddenly sad?

591
00:39:11.109 --> 00:39:12.208
I?

592
00:39:13.227 --> 00:39:14.326
Can't be.

593
00:39:18.062 --> 00:39:19.201
What's wrong with you?

594
00:39:19.940 --> 00:39:21.075
You'll fight again.

595
00:39:21.099 --> 00:39:22.358
- Come on!
- Come on!

596
00:39:23.137 --> 00:39:24.516
And why is it so official?

597
00:39:24.775 --> 00:39:26.314
We are all the same age.

598
00:39:26.573 --> 00:39:27.748
Relax.

599
00:39:27.772 --> 00:39:30.945
And what? I came here
not looking for new friends.

600
00:39:30.969 --> 00:39:32.068
Certainly.

601
00:39:32.527 --> 00:39:33.826
This is not homecoming.

602
00:39:36.164 --> 00:39:37.263
Thank you.

603
00:39:39.481 --> 00:39:40.580
Thank you.

604
00:39:42.358 --> 00:39:43.457
Let's have some tea.

605
00:39:46.274 --> 00:39:47.373
Hot!

606
00:39:49.111 --> 00:39:50.290
Very hot!

607
00:39:50.949 --> 00:39:52.643
How do you drink it? Fine?

608
00:39:52.667 --> 00:39:53.766
- Yes!
- Yes!

609
00:39:54.066 --> 00:39:56.444
This is boiling water! What are you carrying?

610
00:39:57.502 --> 00:39:58.681
You can drink.

611
00:39:59.381 --> 00:40:00.480
It's already cooled down.

612
00:40:37.782 --> 00:40:39.241
Assholes.

613
00:41:22.378 --> 00:41:23.832
- Nobody?
- Nobody, nobody.

614
00:41:23.856 --> 00:41:24.955
Let's go.

615
00:41:26.773 --> 00:41:28.312
No one? No one? No one?

616
00:41:33.087 --> 00:41:34.186
Look.

617
00:41:36.364 --> 00:41:37.463
What is this?

618
00:41:38.482 --> 00:41:40.699
Our sweet win!

619
00:41:42.118 --> 00:41:43.852
What will we spend it on?

620
00:41:43.876 --> 00:41:47.568
Let's buy good down jackets for mom,
grandma, children and Sol!

621
00:41:47.592 --> 00:41:49.127
And we’ll fix your mother-in-law’s teeth!

622
00:41:49.151 --> 00:41:51.688
And now you can rent a house!

623
00:41:51.788 --> 00:41:55.081
But all our 300,000 will be spent on this.
What's left?

624
00:41:55.105 --> 00:41:59.680
Where have you seen this, my dear?
for a young family to live with their parents?

625
00:42:02.577 --> 00:42:05.710
But usually the winnings are greater.
Ten million.

626
00:42:05.734 --> 00:42:07.708
And we only have 300,000.

627
00:42:07.732 --> 00:42:10.386
By the way, there are many winners this time.

628
00:42:10.410 --> 00:42:12.024
50 people!

629
00:42:12.048 --> 00:42:13.946
- Go crazy.
- Is it true?

630
00:42:16.883 --> 00:42:23.297
6, 18, 28, 30, 38, 40.

631
00:42:24.875 --> 00:42:26.254
41.

632
00:42:27.952 --> 00:42:29.171
What are these numbers?

633
00:42:31.069 --> 00:42:36.603
Some man, oh-so-lucky,
told these numbers to my sister.

634
00:42:36.743 --> 00:42:39.561
But I don't believe it, no, no.

635
00:42:39.860 --> 00:42:42.234
We have lucky numbers here!

636
00:42:42.258 --> 00:42:44.711
- So what's there? What?
- What's there?

637
00:42:44.735 --> 00:42:46.873
It's still not true.

638
00:42:50.090 --> 00:42:53.626
Well, listen carefully!

639
00:42:54.446 --> 00:42:58.138
6, 18, 28,

640
00:42:58.162 --> 00:43:03.656
30, 38, 40, 41.

641
00:43:04.276 --> 00:43:07.888
- And ra-a-a-az!
- Everyone here!

642
00:43:07.912 --> 00:43:10.006
- 6!
- 6!

643
00:43:10.030 --> 00:43:11.445
- 18!
- 18!

644
00:43:11.469 --> 00:43:12.687
Go crazy.

645
00:43:12.787 --> 00:43:14.921
So, everyone in that store is lucky!

646
00:43:14.945 --> 00:43:18.242
This year luck smiled on you,
beloved.

647
00:43:19.620 --> 00:43:20.879
How good!

648
00:43:21.219 --> 00:43:22.398
OK!

649
00:43:22.857 --> 00:43:25.914
A friend called you to audition.
Go.

650
00:43:26.773 --> 00:43:27.872
What?

651
00:43:28.052 --> 00:43:29.151
Seriously?

652
00:43:29.530 --> 00:43:32.703
Fate is finally on your side.
Try it once.

653
00:43:32.727 --> 00:43:34.466
- Expensive!
- But!

654
00:43:34.565 --> 00:43:36.060
This is the last audition.

655
00:43:36.084 --> 00:43:37.658
Expensive!

656
00:43:37.682 --> 00:43:40.376
Thank you!

657
00:43:40.400 --> 00:43:44.695
You are my best!

658
00:43:44.835 --> 00:43:46.969
It's time to go get the kids.

659
00:43:46.993 --> 00:43:48.372
Yes, let's go.

660
00:43:48.791 --> 00:43:50.805
- What will we eat today?
- Beef?

661
00:43:50.829 --> 00:43:53.007
Let's!

662
00:43:53.067 --> 00:43:56.599
Thank you, sister!

663
00:43:56.623 --> 00:43:58.681
Thank you for coming.

664
00:43:58.941 --> 00:44:01.874
Producer Lim made a mistake.
Let's forget everything.

665
00:44:01.898 --> 00:44:04.356
Actually Sung Jae...

666
00:44:12.088 --> 00:44:13.187
Of course.

667
00:44:13.287 --> 00:44:14.426
My God.

668
00:44:15.325 --> 00:44:18.102
What a kind heart you have.

669
00:44:21.479 --> 00:44:24.615
- How do you like the food?
- Yes, very tasty.

670
00:44:25.554 --> 00:44:27.808
When will we start filming?

671
00:44:27.832 --> 00:44:31.684
First we need to decide
with the director.

672
00:44:31.708 --> 00:44:32.807
By the way...

673
00:44:33.307 --> 00:44:35.125
is it possible to add...

674
00:44:35.265 --> 00:44:37.163
some changes to the script?

675
00:44:37.742 --> 00:44:39.840
A... Why?

676
00:44:40.180 --> 00:44:43.636
The ending seems a little sad to me.

677
00:44:43.976 --> 00:44:46.749
Right. The world is already full of sorrows.

678
00:44:46.773 --> 00:44:49.790
People won't like the sad ending.

679
00:44:50.410 --> 00:44:51.509
I think...

680
00:44:51.768 --> 00:44:55.021
this ending is the most logical
for the film.

681
00:44:55.045 --> 00:44:57.339
God. He didn't even finish.

682
00:44:57.363 --> 00:45:00.340
We need to listen to opinions
our actor.

683
00:45:02.118 --> 00:45:04.615
What would you change, Sung Jae?

684
00:45:06.194 --> 00:45:09.051
All the memories come back to the guy
about a girl.

685
00:45:09.111 --> 00:45:10.809
They are dating.

686
00:45:11.469 --> 00:45:13.247
And they fall in love again.

687
00:45:13.826 --> 00:45:14.925
Such is fate.

688
00:45:15.185 --> 00:45:18.078
Wow. A real melodrama.

689
00:45:18.102 --> 00:45:19.680
But I don't like it.

690
00:45:21.099 --> 00:45:25.075
Back to hell again -
not the best ending.

691
00:45:25.255 --> 00:45:27.988
If they meet, the guy will die again.

692
00:45:28.012 --> 00:45:29.347
It's unbearable.

693
00:45:29.371 --> 00:45:31.704
He constantly saves her and dies.

694
00:45:31.728 --> 00:45:34.985
All the same, our time is measured.
Once upon a time...

695
00:45:35.405 --> 00:45:37.059
the person must die.

696
00:45:37.083 --> 00:45:40.416
But the girl wants him to live long.

697
00:45:40.440 --> 00:45:42.138
You can suffer for a long time.

698
00:45:42.837 --> 00:45:45.730
Or you can live for a short time with your beloved.

699
00:45:45.754 --> 00:45:48.172
And how will this relationship end?

700
00:45:49.071 --> 00:45:51.049
The girl will fall in love again...

701
00:45:52.308 --> 00:45:53.806
but in vain.

702
00:45:54.825 --> 00:45:56.124
What is this?

703
00:46:00.979 --> 00:46:04.116
Well, I was just expressing my opinion.

704
00:46:04.855 --> 00:46:06.390
The decision is yours.

705
00:46:06.414 --> 00:46:08.348
- Yes, yes.
- Yes.

706
00:46:08.372 --> 00:46:14.386
And we... We, in turn, will definitely
We will take your proposal into account.

707
00:46:14.565 --> 00:46:16.220
- Yes, yes.
- Eat, eat.

708
00:46:16.244 --> 00:46:18.741
Yes. Very tasty!

709
00:46:27.073 --> 00:46:28.412
Don't follow me!

710
00:46:29.391 --> 00:46:30.490
And I want to.

711
00:46:31.668 --> 00:46:34.322
They themselves said that they could see us.

712
00:46:34.346 --> 00:46:36.044
I don't need problems.

713
00:46:41.059 --> 00:46:42.957
We are business partners.

714
00:46:43.696 --> 00:46:45.071
The work can be discussed.

715
00:46:45.095 --> 00:46:46.709
Is this what you came for?

716
00:46:46.733 --> 00:46:47.828
No.

717
00:46:47.852 --> 00:46:50.550
I wanted to give you a ride, but I don't have a car.

718
00:46:51.169 --> 00:46:52.468
At least I'll walk you to a taxi.

719
00:46:57.163 --> 00:46:58.977
- What's wrong with you?
- In terms of?

720
00:46:59.001 --> 00:47:00.939
You understand me.

721
00:47:02.478 --> 00:47:04.056
You don't have a boyfriend.

722
00:47:05.035 --> 00:47:06.653
You're not dating...

723
00:47:06.953 --> 00:47:09.650
- ...with that detective?
- Why are you asking?

724
00:47:10.030 --> 00:47:11.289
Just...

725
00:47:11.349 --> 00:47:12.847
I think I really...

726
00:47:12.907 --> 00:47:14.326
fell in love with you.

727
00:47:18.462 --> 00:47:21.239
We barely know each other. What other love?

728
00:47:22.258 --> 00:47:24.196
I know it's strange.

729
00:47:25.774 --> 00:47:27.273
But I'm drawn to you.

730
00:47:28.811 --> 00:47:30.150
I think about you

731
00:47:31.329 --> 00:47:32.428
...I'm worried.

732
00:47:37.682 --> 00:47:39.181
Sorry.

733
00:47:40.599 --> 00:47:41.698
Can you...

734
00:47:42.637 --> 00:47:44.735
just forget about me?

735
00:47:45.954 --> 00:47:47.053
Why?

736
00:47:47.473 --> 00:47:51.009
If you contact me
will you destroy three generations?

737
00:47:58.661 --> 00:47:59.760
I have...

738
00:48:01.419 --> 00:48:03.117
have a loved one.

739
00:48:05.295 --> 00:48:06.913
And I...

740
00:48:09.131 --> 00:48:10.949
I really appreciate it.

741
00:48:16.124 --> 00:48:18.302
Therefore, nothing will work out for us.

742
00:48:20.559 --> 00:48:22.857
I beg you, Sung Jae...

743
00:48:24.595 --> 00:48:26.653
don't come near me anymore.

744
00:48:34.186 --> 00:48:35.525
This is not the first time...

745
00:48:36.863 --> 00:48:38.162
you refuse me.

746
00:48:40.859 --> 00:48:44.076
Understood. You won't be nice by force.

747
00:48:44.695 --> 00:48:45.794
I won't...

748
00:48:46.374 --> 00:48:47.553
cross boundaries.

749
00:48:50.170 --> 00:48:51.628
Thank you.

750
00:48:52.488 --> 00:48:53.587
And...

751
00:48:53.926 --> 00:48:56.703
I was really rude to you.

752
00:48:57.403 --> 00:48:58.701
Sorry.

753
00:49:00.360 --> 00:49:01.858
Are you saying goodbye?

754
00:49:02.717 --> 00:49:04.416
We'll see each other again.

755
00:49:09.630 --> 00:49:11.045
I'm already embarrassed.

756
00:49:11.069 --> 00:49:13.047
Where will we meet?

757
00:49:15.984 --> 00:49:17.243
Ryu Sung Jae...

758
00:49:20.180 --> 00:49:22.558
All the best to you.

759
00:49:25.015 --> 00:49:26.274
Goodbye.

760
00:49:43.716 --> 00:49:45.934
You already have enough to do.

761
00:49:46.434 --> 00:49:47.892
Have you had dinner?

762
00:49:49.151 --> 00:49:50.809
You are without a car.

763
00:49:53.147 --> 00:49:54.286
Did you drink a lot?

764
00:49:55.544 --> 00:49:56.643
Enough.

765
00:49:59.061 --> 00:50:01.359
Why are you so worried about me?

766
00:50:02.298 --> 00:50:04.072
Don't fall in love with your aunt.

767
00:50:04.096 --> 00:50:05.395
What, you can’t?

768
00:50:07.253 --> 00:50:08.947
- What?
- When I see you,

769
00:50:08.971 --> 00:50:10.550
Everything is confused in my head.

770
00:50:13.287 --> 00:50:14.705
What nonsense?

771
00:50:14.765 --> 00:50:19.980
We have known each other for a long time, more than 10 years,
but there's something wrong with my heart.

772
00:50:20.360 --> 00:50:22.258
Maybe I liked you?

773
00:50:22.318 --> 00:50:24.216
I don't remember.

774
00:50:24.915 --> 00:50:26.813
But it seems so.

775
00:50:27.592 --> 00:50:29.051
Strange things.

776
00:50:29.630 --> 00:50:31.009
Probably...

777
00:50:32.028 --> 00:50:33.522
it seemed to you.

778
00:50:33.546 --> 00:50:34.645
Yes.

779
00:50:35.425 --> 00:50:36.519
It seemed.

780
00:50:36.543 --> 00:50:37.642
Do you think so?

781
00:50:37.822 --> 00:50:39.680
Let's start dating and check?

782
00:50:41.059 --> 00:50:43.197
I know this is not true.

783
00:50:47.772 --> 00:50:49.431
Because of these feelings...

784
00:50:50.769 --> 00:50:53.946
I'm afraid of losing you.
That's why I'm silent.

785
00:50:55.285 --> 00:50:56.943
It's hard for me.

786
00:50:57.363 --> 00:51:00.460
But I decided to tell the truth
so you don't get scared.

787
00:51:03.596 --> 00:51:04.695
I...

788
00:51:06.154 --> 00:51:08.372
I still can’t forget him.

789
00:51:09.710 --> 00:51:10.809
I know.

790
00:51:10.989 --> 00:51:12.887
You still haven't said who he is.

791
00:51:14.146 --> 00:51:15.245
Coming soon...

792
00:51:15.345 --> 00:51:16.923
everything will change.

793
00:51:18.501 --> 00:51:20.719
Yes. Everyone will change.

794
00:51:20.899 --> 00:51:22.038
Must.

795
00:51:22.937 --> 00:51:24.036
And you...

796
00:51:24.256 --> 00:51:25.395
and Sung Jae...

797
00:51:26.094 --> 00:51:27.193
...and me.

798
00:51:38.002 --> 00:51:39.816
Grandma, why aren't you sleeping?

799
00:51:39.840 --> 00:51:41.539
My Salt has arrived.

800
00:51:41.718 --> 00:51:43.137
Are you hungry?

801
00:51:44.036 --> 00:51:45.255
Grandmother!

802
00:51:48.392 --> 00:51:50.370
Do you remember me?

803
00:51:51.269 --> 00:51:53.886
That's it, don't glare at me.

804
00:51:58.142 --> 00:52:00.400
Do you remember after all these years?

805
00:52:00.699 --> 00:52:03.117
Did you think grandma forgot everything?

806
00:52:04.695 --> 00:52:06.154
No no!

807
00:52:06.494 --> 00:52:10.270
Memories never disappear.

808
00:52:11.489 --> 00:52:16.659
How much we see and hear
and feel for life.

809
00:52:16.683 --> 00:52:18.102
Where will these moments go?

810
00:52:18.641 --> 00:52:21.818
They are kept deep in the heart.

811
00:52:22.877 --> 00:52:26.174
And even if the brain forgets everything...

812
00:52:26.633 --> 00:52:30.845
heart will be carefully preserved
every moment.

813
00:52:30.869 --> 00:52:31.968
With me...

814
00:52:33.067 --> 00:52:34.841
something strange is happening.

815
00:52:34.865 --> 00:52:36.799
There's something wrong with my heart.

816
00:52:36.823 --> 00:52:38.282
Strange things.

817
00:52:44.136 --> 00:52:46.030
Is it true?

818
00:52:46.054 --> 00:52:48.272
Of course. Is it true.

819
00:52:50.210 --> 00:52:55.265
I wandered for a long time in distant places,
hidden corners of your memory.

820
00:52:56.324 --> 00:53:01.379
I managed to return to my childhood,
to be in my mother's arms again.

821
00:53:02.318 --> 00:53:06.893
And I managed to meet my 18-year-old son-in-law.

822
00:53:07.313 --> 00:53:09.890
But my granddaughter missed me a lot...

823
00:53:13.187 --> 00:53:17.243
so I had to come back here.

824
00:53:20.859 --> 00:53:23.956
Come back often, grandma. Fine?

825
00:53:26.813 --> 00:53:27.912
Fine.

826
00:53:37.483 --> 00:53:39.101
Agreed.

827
00:54:11.888 --> 00:54:12.987
Detective So!

828
00:54:13.447 --> 00:54:15.860
Have the recordings from the black box arrived yet?

829
00:54:15.884 --> 00:54:18.981
Yes, everything is there. Even the name of the company.

830
00:54:24.755 --> 00:54:27.728
We are planning to start filming
next year.

831
00:54:27.752 --> 00:54:30.849
We are negotiating with Choi Gi Son.

832
00:54:31.508 --> 00:54:33.247
“Love again”, have you heard?

833
00:54:34.266 --> 00:54:37.678
In any case we have
a couple of directors in mind...

834
00:54:37.702 --> 00:54:39.680
- Sorry...
- Yes?

835
00:54:40.300 --> 00:54:41.798
When will Lim Sol come?

836
00:54:44.535 --> 00:54:48.428
Well... From this day on, the script
I'll do it.

837
00:54:48.452 --> 00:54:51.385
Producer Lim quit.

838
00:54:51.409 --> 00:54:52.508
Quit?

839
00:54:53.007 --> 00:54:55.301
So you didn't know.

840
00:54:55.325 --> 00:54:57.498
I persuaded her as best I could,

841
00:54:57.522 --> 00:54:59.536
but she said she wanted to study.

842
00:54:59.560 --> 00:55:00.939
And she left.

843
00:55:07.912 --> 00:55:09.051
Ryu Sung Jae...

844
00:55:10.310 --> 00:55:12.727
All the best to you.

845
00:55:12.827 --> 00:55:13.926
This...

846
00:55:14.146 --> 00:55:16.084
was the last time.

847
00:55:23.976 --> 00:55:25.674
How to give them away?

848
00:55:26.174 --> 00:55:27.792
We won't see each other again.

849
00:55:34.126 --> 00:55:35.385
Sit down, Sung Jae.

850
00:55:59.980 --> 00:56:01.079
What is this?

851
00:56:07.932 --> 00:56:10.869
5, 6, 6, 3. Whose numbers are these?

852
00:56:11.449 --> 00:56:12.548
Just a second.

853
00:56:22.078 --> 00:56:23.177
Found it.

854
00:56:24.236 --> 00:56:27.049
- It's definitely him.
- Send a photo to the victim...

855
00:56:27.073 --> 00:56:29.610
- ...and ask for an arrest warrant.
- I understand you.

856
00:56:30.749 --> 00:56:33.123
- Is Kim Yong Soo at work?
- Yes.

857
00:56:33.147 --> 00:56:34.566
When will it finish?

858
00:56:51.568 --> 00:56:54.941
Ryu Sung Jae recorded a song
for your film.

859
00:56:54.965 --> 00:56:56.064
Listen to the recording.

860
00:56:56.164 --> 00:56:57.982
It's her...

861
00:57:00.440 --> 00:57:03.257
"TORY RAIN"

862
00:57:05.475 --> 00:57:09.331
Memories never disappear.

863
00:57:09.510 --> 00:57:14.641
How much we see and hear
and feel for life.

864
00:57:14.665 --> 00:57:16.084
Where will these moments go?

865
00:57:16.703 --> 00:57:19.836
They are kept deep in the heart.

866
00:57:19.860 --> 00:57:23.197
And even if the brain forgets everything...

867
00:57:23.576 --> 00:57:27.792
heart will be carefully preserved
every moment.

868
00:57:56.943 --> 00:57:58.801
I haven't heard her for a long time.

869
00:59:38.122 --> 00:59:39.221
Tae Sung!

870
00:59:39.760 --> 00:59:42.454
We have received an arrest warrant.
Let's call for reinforcements.

871
00:59:42.478 --> 00:59:44.332
All that remains is to capture Kim Yong Soo.

872
00:59:44.356 --> 00:59:46.809
It turns out he was already sitting.

873
00:59:46.833 --> 00:59:50.130
In 2008 he was imprisoned
for attempted murder.

874
00:59:50.190 --> 00:59:55.045
Then, it seems, he was involved in his business
Detective Kim On Joo.

875
00:59:55.345 --> 00:59:57.083
- Your father.
- What?

876
00:59:57.183 --> 00:59:58.721
What a coincidence.

877
01:00:02.617 --> 01:00:03.716
I've arrived.

878
01:00:24.276 --> 01:00:25.650
Any problems?

879
01:00:25.674 --> 01:00:27.413
Come out, let's talk.

880
01:00:27.832 --> 01:00:29.251
I have a question for you.

881
01:00:31.828 --> 01:00:32.927
Curse.

882
01:00:36.464 --> 01:00:38.162
Detective So, get in!

883
01:00:54.685 --> 01:00:58.777
We need reinforcements. The suspect is driving
towards Gangneung Bridge.

884
01:00:58.801 --> 01:01:00.140
Send reinforcements!

885
01:01:11.748 --> 01:01:13.047
Damn it!

886
01:01:15.904 --> 01:01:17.283
Sick bastard.

887
01:01:25.774 --> 01:01:28.388
- Sun Jae, I'll be right there.
- I am waiting.

888
01:01:28.412 --> 01:01:29.511
Fine.

889
01:01:54.266 --> 01:01:57.443
Time passes... Thank you for surviving.

890
01:02:20.599 --> 01:02:21.738
Has it snowed?

891
01:02:56.284 --> 01:02:59.101
I was waiting for you.

892
01:03:07.273 --> 01:03:08.851
Uncle!

893
01:03:28.931 --> 01:03:30.030
Salt!

894
01:03:48.312 --> 01:03:50.729
Song Jae! Song Jae!

895
01:04:00.939 --> 01:04:02.038
Salt...

896
01:04:04.216 --> 01:04:05.315
Salt!

897
01:04:14.246 --> 01:04:15.345
Salt...

898
01:04:25.514 --> 01:04:26.613
Salt!

899
01:04:36.144 --> 01:04:37.283
Salt!

900
01:05:03.836 --> 01:05:05.614
Get out of the way, freaks!

901
01:05:19.900 --> 01:05:20.999
Get out!

902
01:06:26.354 --> 01:06:28.332
Why did you save me?

903
01:06:28.392 --> 01:06:29.966
Would you leave him to die?

904
01:06:29.990 --> 01:06:32.723
Why did you save me and make me disabled?

905
01:06:32.747 --> 01:06:34.206
For what?

906
01:06:37.183 --> 01:06:38.282
Salt...

907
01:06:41.578 --> 01:06:43.077
Why are you crying?

908
01:06:49.051 --> 01:06:51.149
Sol, you...

909
01:06:52.088 --> 01:06:53.187
I like you very much.

910
01:06:53.287 --> 01:06:55.265
Salt! Lim Sol!

911
01:06:58.402 --> 01:06:59.501
Salt...

912
01:06:59.760 --> 01:07:03.417
If we met again
I would say that.

913
01:07:04.076 --> 01:07:05.854
I liked you too.

914
01:07:06.114 --> 01:07:07.573
I missed you.

915
01:07:07.832 --> 01:07:10.929
I really wanted to see you, Sung Jae.

916
01:07:18.462 --> 01:07:21.199
Will I die because of you?

917
01:07:21.738 --> 01:07:22.837
Saving you?

918
01:07:24.296 --> 01:07:26.953
Sol, don't run away anymore.

919
01:07:27.253 --> 01:07:28.552
And don't hide your feelings.

920
01:07:29.610 --> 01:07:32.508
I'll die saving you, and that's okay.

921
01:07:33.047 --> 01:07:34.146
I don't care.

922
01:07:34.645 --> 01:07:37.223
Song Jae!

923
01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:41.259
I like you.

924
01:07:41.439 --> 01:07:42.977
I like you, Sung Jae.

925
01:07:43.357 --> 01:07:44.456
I love you.

926
01:07:44.835 --> 01:07:45.934
I love you, Sol.

927
01:07:48.591 --> 01:07:49.810
Maybe...

928
01:07:50.070 --> 01:07:53.287
we didn't have to meet.

929
01:07:53.866 --> 01:07:56.683
Yes, there was no need.

930
01:08:01.379 --> 01:08:03.676
Maybe this is fate.

931
01:08:04.735 --> 01:08:08.991
It can't be changed
and you can’t refuse it.

932
01:08:10.290 --> 01:08:15.904
If so, Sol, my destiny is
our past and future.

933
01:08:16.164 --> 01:08:19.501
It doesn't matter when we meet.

934
01:08:20.280 --> 01:08:22.018
I will love you.

935
01:08:25.954 --> 01:08:27.133
Song Jae...

936
01:08:28.671 --> 01:08:29.770
Salt...

937
01:08:30.509 --> 01:08:31.608
I love you.

938
01:09:06.753 --> 01:09:09.810
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

939
01:09:10.310 --> 01:09:12.847
Salt! Sorry I'm late.

940
01:09:14.026 --> 01:09:15.325
Stop, Kim Yong Soo.

941
01:09:16.224 --> 01:09:19.117
Remember. E-tai-na.

942
01:09:19.141 --> 01:09:23.037
-Are you crazy?
- Maybe I should grab you and run away?

943
01:09:23.417 --> 01:09:26.633
By the way, we look like newlyweds.

944
01:09:27.293 --> 01:09:28.552
Newlyweds?

945
01:09:29.051 --> 01:09:31.345
- The moment has come.
- Really...

946
01:09:31.369 --> 01:09:33.147
No, not now.

947
01:09:33.966 --> 01:09:38.102
Sometimes I'm afraid that you will come again
you will disappear somewhere.

948
01:09:38.202 --> 01:09:42.693
Sol, be with me always.

949
01:09:42.717 --> 01:09:46.090
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

950
01:09:46.114 --> 01:09:49.011
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

